<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76263" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχμάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>grip fast</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				484
			</span></i> (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέσον τινὰ ὀ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Or.</u>
				265
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν λεωργὸν ὀχμάσαι . . ἐν
				ἀρρήκτοις πέδαις</span>
			<i>bind</i> him <i>fast</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίς ἐν φάραγγί σ᾽
				ὤχμασεν</span><i>;</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				618
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππον τ᾽ ὀχμάζει</span>
			<i>he makes</i> the horse <i>obedient to the bit</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				817
			</span></i> (and this, acc. to Sch.<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.743
			</span></i>, is the proper sense). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bear, carry</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρεος ὀχμάζουσα . . σάκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.743
				</span></i>
			; <i>uphold</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φελλοὶ . . δόλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					3.374
				</span></i>
			.</div>
